04</b></a></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:80%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><a href="#Section1004EntireAgreementAssignment_370"><font style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Entire Agreement; Assignment</font></a></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:6%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">A-1-57</p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:top;width:14%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 7.2pt;"><a href="#Section1005PartiesinInterest_125248"><b style="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">Section&#160;10.05</b></a></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:80%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><a href="#Section1005PartiesinInterest_125248"><font style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Parties in Interest</font></a></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:6%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">A-1-57</p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:top;width:14%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 7.2pt;"><a href="#Section1006GoverningLawArbitration_27522"><b style="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">Section&#160;10.06</b></a></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:80%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><a href="#Section1006GoverningLawArbitration_27522"><font style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Governing Law; Arbitration</font></a></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:6%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">A-1-57</p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:top;width:14%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 7.2pt;"><a href="#Section1007WaiverofJuryTrial_559096"><b style="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">Section&#160;10.07</b></a></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:80%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><a href="#Section1007WaiverofJuryTrial_559096"><font style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Waiver of Jury Trial</font></a></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:6%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">A-1-58</p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:top;width:14%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 7.2pt;"><a href="#Section1008Headings_239196"><b style="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">Section&#160;10.08</b></a></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:80%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><a href="#Section1008Headings_239196"><font style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Headings</font></a></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:6%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">A-1-58</p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:top;width:14%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 7.2pt;"><a href="#Section1009Counterparts_468535"><b style="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">Section&#160;10.09</b></a></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:80%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><a href="#Section1009Counterparts_468535"><font style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Counterparts</font></a></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:6%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">A-1-58</p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:top;width:14%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 7.2pt;"><a href="#Section1010SpecificPerformance_618439"><b style="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">Section&#160;10.10</b></a></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:80%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><a href="#Section1010SpecificPerformance_618439"><font style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Specific Performance</font></a></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:6%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">A-1-58</p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:top;width:14%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 7.2pt;"><a href="#Section1011LegalRepresentation_540156"><b style="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">Section&#160;10.11</b></a></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:80%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><a href="#Section1011LegalRepresentation_540156"><font style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Legal Representation</font></a></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:6%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'